sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    loop each wayside, every step (_outputs)
        M->>M: _report(wayside_id, controller, time_s)
        M->>W: program
        W-->>M: return the committed Program, or None
        M->>M: _report internal: CtcReport(wayside, line, sent_at_s, ready, reason, blocks from _readback)
        Note right of M: Each block: occupied, and the Track Model's own switch, crossing and signal read-back. No failures, no trains.
    end
    M-->>H: return TrackControllerOutputs.ctc_reports
    H->>H: _finish_tick internal: next tick, inputs_for(): track_controller_to_ctc(...)
    H->>CTC: STEP: one report per wayside
    alt every wayside on a line is ready
        CTC->>CTC: step internal: the line is ready: dispatch, suggest speeds and authorities (UC-10)
    else any is not
        CTC->>CTC: step internal: send nothing on that line, show which waysides are not ready
    end
